    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kody, a modern gym rat gets zapped by strange lightning and time-travels to 1898.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A BARA, choices matter, alternate history, Visual Novel Musical set in the East Coast of USA.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on a visual novel engine with RPG elements.  <br>Choices matter! Not only must Kody decide if he should speak of the future, but also must decide which details he will share. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The potential of 4 love interests or enemies await. LGBTQ+ with romance options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game installment covers a full day in Kody's adventure. This is Day 1 of 8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~15 hours of gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voiced characters with separate volume control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complex flow-chart leads to many multiple endings by the end of Day 8, possibly even a thruple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Kody be smart enough to navigate the past? Will he end up in a Sanatorium? Or, will he be a Himbo?\u00a0 Player choices matter...</p>",
